<title>BELGIUM: FORECAST - Belgian inflation seen easier in April.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Belgian inflation seen easier in April.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian year-on-year inflation was expected to be on average 1.37 percent in April, down from a reported 1.46 percent in March, according to five analysts polled by Reuter.</p>
<p>Month-on-month, April inflation is seen at an average 0.07 percent. The index fell by 0.45 percent in March.</p>
<p>The Belgian Economics Ministry is due to release provisional April inflation data on Tuesday.</p>
